Ferraloom is an independently implemented Minecraft Java server written in Rust.
It is distributed under GPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.

The earlier Pumpkin-based prototype is preserved on archive/pumpkin-prototype-ee7,
including its original attribution, licenses and evidence. This branch removes
that engine. Historical compatibility reports retain their original provenance
and do not establish behavior of the independent server.

Minecraft assets and data belong to Mojang Studios/Microsoft. The official
server is used as a pinned behavioral reference and is not redistributed.
